          "scenario": "You are tasked with implementing Infrastructure as Code for a mission-critical payments service that requires high availability, automated safety checks, and deterministic promotion across staging and production.",
          "goal": "Construct an end-to-end automated pipeline configuration that validates code quality, executes hermetic tests, signs the resulting artifact, and deploys it safely.",
